    edu_zonasDeMoneynessNuevas_d71f9261: 'MONEYNESS ZONES (new) → Light green = ITM, Yellow = ATM, Light red = OTM. Helps visualize where each strike sits.',
    edu_laDiferenciaEntreAmbas_439232b3: 'The DIFFERENCE between both lines = extrinsic value (time + IV). Negative Theta reduces it daily.',
