  cotIndexSecTitle: "The COT Index",
  cotIndexSecDesc: "Raw position numbers are hard to compare over time. The COT Index rescales net positioning to 0–100 over a lookback window (often 3 years), so extremes jump out. Readings above ~80 or below ~20 are the actionable zones.",
